ID: B2-Ch07a-Job
TEXT:

 "Hey, you're the hero, not me. Isn't saving cities supposed to be your job?"

"Normally, yes," Daren says. "Though my goal in crossing the ocean was to secure the Magium so I could protect people on a far greater scale. Still, I hear you. The corruption here runs deeper than I imagined, and Thilias is supposedly the most civilized realm on the island. Something has to change."

"In any case," Kate says, her voice cutting cool and sharp, "we shouldn't place too much faith in Eiden's offer of power. The conditions are deliberately vague, and Eiden breaks whim on a coin toss."

"Agreed," Daren nods. "Given how little we know of the calamity, the only certain prevention is neutralizing both Eiden and the dragon—and neither will go down quietly."

